  "details": "Description\n\nThe world audio percentage turned into the letters NaN and i can't move the slider anymore, causing the world volume to be permanently muted.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI don't know how the bug happened nor why it happened, and nothing i've tried has been able to fix the problem.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-19_00-55-07.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_4782afcc-fed8-4c75-9b1b-9bab582bc9b5/1/file)",
